# Patterns anchor at the context root, so a bare `.venv` matched only
# ./.venv: `COPY backend/` carried backend/.venv — the developer's whole venv,
# dev tools and their CVEs included — into the image. `**/` reaches them all.
.git
.github
**/__pycache__
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/*.pyc
**/.mypy_cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/htmlcov
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/test-results
.env
.env.*
*.md
!README.md
.DS_Store
data/
